<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 540px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334055">OpenFlare runs your Worker on <b style="font-weight: 600; color: #0F1A2E">unmodified workerd</b> and builds the platform around it in Rust: signed deploys, KV, R2, D1, Queues and Durable Objects, one isolated process per tenant. Your wrangler config stays the source of truth.</p>
